orbits of bottom discs), OPEN[V-FLOOR] (nothing in Moh (1)–(13) forces
q = Ω(1)), OPEN[STAR-REALISABILITY] (a skeleton whose bottom polynomial
p(π) is forced to have a repeated root dies).

