+```text
+m=70, M=[28,103], V_s=5, u=25, V_2=1, q=1/2,  A_2=18, |O|=18, N=9
+m=70, M=[28,103], V_s=6, u=30, V_2=1, q=9/13, A_2=13, |O|=13, N=9
+m=70, M=[40,103], V_s=4, u=28, V_2=1, q=9/17, A_2=17, |O|=17, N=9
